sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int64/InPlace.lean#L656-L659"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int64/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Int64Array.Slice.foldrInPlace\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int64Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldrInPlace</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int64/Slice.html#ScalarArray.Int64Array.Slice\">Int64Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">init</span> : <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">k</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Slice/Operations.html#Std.Slice.size\">Std.Slice.size</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int64\">Int64</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int64\">Int64</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int64/Slice.html#ScalarArray.Int64Array.Slice\">Int64Array.Slice</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Replaces each element of the slice while threading an accumulator, like `foldlInPlace` but from\nthe last element to the first: for each `k < s.size`, from `s.size - 1` down to `0`, the element\n`x` at index `k` of the slice becomes the first component of `f k hk x b`, whose second component\nis the next accumulator. Returns the new slice and the last accumulator.\n\nThe array is made exclusive once, before the loop, which then stores without checks.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int64/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Int64Array.Slice.foldrInPlace","kind":"def","line":631,"name":"ScalarArray.Int64Array.Slice.foldrInPlace","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int64/InPlace.lean#L631-L642"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int64/InPlace.html#ScalarArray.Int64Array.Slice.foldrInPlace.loop\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int64Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldrInPlace</span>.<span class=\"name\">loop</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">k</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int64\">I